"Live Translate is connected again." = "Live Translate 已重新连上。";
"Live Translate refused the connection (check the Gemini key); captions are translated by the text model." = "Live Translate 拒绝连接（请检查 Gemini 密钥），字幕改用文字模型翻译。";
"Alibaba's small open model running on the Mac: the smallest download (about 1.4 GB) and quick, also does replies and summaries. Its translations are rougher than Gemma's: the meaning is mostly right, with an occasional slip. Set it up below." = "阿里巴巴的小型开放模型，在 Mac 上运行：下载最小（约 1.4 GB）、速度快，也能生成回复和摘要。翻译比 Gemma 粗糙：意思大多正确，偶尔漏字或用词不准。在下方设置。";
"One click installs what is missing: Ollama from ollama.com (about 230 MB, signature checked) and the chosen model. TranslateGemma only translates captions (replies and the summary then use another model); Gemma 4 and Qwen3 also do replies and summaries, and Qwen3 1.7B is the smallest (the one the original app runs offline). Text never leaves this Mac." = "一键安装缺少的部分：从 ollama.com 下载 Ollama（约 230 MB，会检查签名）和所选模型。TranslateGemma 只翻译字幕（回复和摘要改用其他模型）；Gemma 4 和 Qwen3 也能生成回复和摘要，Qwen3 1.7B 最小（就是原版 app 离线使用的那个）。文字不会离开这台 Mac。";
"Qwen3 1.7B (local Ollama, free, smallest)" = "Qwen3 1.7B（本地 Ollama，免费，最小）";
"Qwen3 1.7B: smallest and quickest, about 1.4 GB, rougher wording" = "Qwen3 1.7B：最小最快，约 1.4 GB，用词较粗糙";
"The local model is not set up yet: Settings → Listen & Translate → Local model on this Mac → Set Up." = "本地模型还没设置好：设置 →“听与译”→“在这台 Mac 上运行的本地模型（免费、离线）”→“设置”。";
"Each session gets a folder with transcript.md and summary.md, and for each segment its own transcript (01-name.md) and, if chosen, its own recording (01-name.mp4 or .wav). Other people's voices are kept: check that everyone agrees." = "每次聆听会有一个文件夹，里面是 transcript.md 和 summary.md，每个段落还有自己的逐字稿（01-名称.md），选择后也有自己的录音（01-名称.mp4 或 .wav）。这会保存别人的声音，请先确认大家都同意。";
"MP4 (AAC, about 30 MB an hour, plays almost anywhere)" = "MP4（AAC，一小时约 30 MB，几乎哪里都能播放）";
"Recording format" = "录音格式";
"The recording could not be written: %@" = "录音无法写入：%@";
"WAV (uncompressed, about 115 MB an hour, plays on anything)" = "WAV（未压缩，一小时约 115 MB，任何设备都能播放）";
"! Cue" = "! 提示";
"# Title" = "# 标题";
"## Subheading" = "## 小标";
"%@ lines have no translation yet — Fill In Missing Halves adds them." = "还有 %@ 句没有对照——按“补对照”就会补上。";
"1 line has no translation yet — Fill In Missing Halves adds it." = "还有 1 句没有对照——按“补对照”就会补上。";
"> Chinese" = "> 中文";
"A block to copy with one click (links, commands)" = "可一键复制的区块（链接、命令）";
"A gray cue, not read aloud (such as “switch to slide 2”)" = "灰色提示，不用念（例如“切到第 2 张幻灯片”）";
"A line to read aloud (Chinese works too: Fill In Missing Halves turns it into the language you speak)" = "要念的句子（写中文也可以，按“补对照”转成你说的语言）";
"A line written another way still shows. While you edit, the bottom of the window counts the lines that have no translation yet." = "格式写错也不会读不到，一样会显示。编辑时，窗口下方会提醒还有几句没有对照。";
"A plain line" = "普通一行";
"A question prepared in advance" = "预先准备的提问";
"A short sample exchange, to see what each window does: no sound, keys or network, nothing saved." = "一段简短的示范对话，看看每个窗口的用途：不用声音、密钥或网络，也不会保存任何东西。";
"A small heading inside a tab" = "分页里的小标题";
"A tab (Opening, Demo, Q&A: name them as you like)" = "一个分页（开场、Demo、Q&A，名称随你取）";
"All keys removed." = "已移除所有密钥。";
"Check for updates when the app starts" = "App 启动时检查更新";
"Checking asks GitHub (api.github.com) for this fork's latest release: when you press the button, and, if turned on, once about 20 seconds after the app starts (a newer version then shows in the caption window's bar)." = "检查更新会向 GitHub（api.github.com）查询这个 fork 的最新版本：在你按下按钮时；若已开启，也会在 App 启动约 20 秒后查一次（有新版本时会显示在字幕窗口下方的工具栏）。";
"Choose a Model" = "选择模型";
"Clear All Keys" = "清除所有密钥";
"Clear All Keys…" = "清除所有密钥…";
"Clear all keys?" = "要清除所有密钥吗？";
"Demo finished. Press Start to listen." = "示范结束。按“开始”聆听。";
"Demo: sample captions, with no sound, keys or network." = "示范：示例字幕，不用声音、密钥或网络。";
"Every speaker name is removed, and no line keeps a speaker, in the captions or in this session's transcript. New voices start again from Speaker 1. Undo in the caption window brings the names back." = "所有讲者名称都会移除，字幕和这次的逐字稿里每一行也不再标示讲者。之后的新声音会从“讲者 1”重新编号。在字幕窗口按“撤销”可以找回这些名称。";
"Fill in the server's address first, such as http://localhost:8000/v1." = "请先填写服务器地址，例如 http://localhost:8000/v1。";
"Format Help" = "格式说明";
"Opens the release page on GitHub." = "打开 GitHub 上的版本发布页面。";
"Play Demo" = "播放示范";
"Q: Question" = "Q: 问题";
"Reset Speakers" = "重置讲者";
"Reset Speakers…" = "重置讲者…";
"Reset speakers?" = "要重置讲者吗？";
"Script format" = "讲稿格式";
"Stop Demo" = "停止示范";
"Test Connection" = "测试连接";
"The Chinese meaning of the line above" = "上一行的中文意思";
"The Gemini, Anthropic, OpenAI and your own server's keys are deleted from your Keychain, and this Mac signs out of the ChatGPT plan. This cannot be undone: you would have to paste the keys again." = "Gemini、Anthropic、OpenAI 和你自己服务器的密钥都会从钥匙串中删除，这台 Mac 也会退出 ChatGPT 套餐。此操作无法撤销：之后需要重新粘贴密钥。";
"The models the server listed: choosing one fills in the model name." = "服务器列出的模型：选一个就会填入模型名称。";
"The server answered, but not with a list of models: check the address (it usually ends in /v1)." = "服务器有响应，但不是模型列表：请检查地址（通常以 /v1 结尾）。";
"Update available: %@" = "有新版本：%@";
"```copy:name … ```" = "```copy:名称 … ```";
"✓ Connected, but the server lists no models." = "✓ 已连接，但服务器没有列出任何模型。";
"✓ Connected: %@ models" = "✓ 已连接：%@ 个模型";
"✓ Connected: 1 model" = "✓ 已连接：1 个模型";
